    "detailed_description": "<h1>ADD TO WISHLIST</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701980/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1730223183\" width=736 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701980/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1730223183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701980/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1730223183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><br><br>Make Your Mark In the World Of Advertising!<br><br>Ad Agency Simulator offers a realistic simulation experience for those looking to embark on a career in the advertising industry. Are you ready to start creating your own advertising designs and managing your advertising agency, starting from a small advertising office?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701980/extras/6abd2b352ec5ba9e9466c21c1805704c.poster.avif?t=1730223183\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701980/extras/6abd2b352ec5ba9e9466c21c1805704c.webm?t=1730223183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701980/extras/6abd2b352ec5ba9e9466c21c1805704c.mp4?t=1730223183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Career Journey: Start with a small office and a computer, design and manage various advertising projects such as logos, signage, posters, billboards, etc., from various businesses in the city.<br><br>Design and Implementation: Bring your projects to life with original designs and place them all around the city. Increase your popularity through customer satisfaction and feedback.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701980/extras/7e4cba92eb3972fbc9f67e99cdfd3720.poster.avif?t=1730223183\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701980/extras/7e4cba92eb3972fbc9f67e99cdfd3720.webm?t=1730223183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701980/extras/7e4cba92eb3972fbc9f67e99cdfd3720.mp4?t=1730223183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Money and Popularity: Earn money by completing projects and increase your popularity by ensuring customer satisfaction. As you grow, take on bigger and more important projects.<br><br>Dive into the World of Advertising: Learn the intricacies of the advertising industry and take the necessary steps to become a successful advertiser. Impress your clients with your creative ideas.<br><br>Forge Your Own Path: Determine how you will manage your company with in-game decisions. Do you want to expand your client base or specialize? The choice is yours!<br><br>Ad Agency Simulator is here to provide you with the complexity and excitement of the advertising world! Are you ready to build your own advertising empire?",
